egion","start":297,"end":318,"description":"Leucine-zipper"},{"type":"Site","start":300,"end":300,"description":"Required for binding TORCs"}],"interfaces":{},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Interacts with PPRC1. Binds DNA as a dimer. This dimer is stabilized by magnesium ions. Interacts, through the bZIP domain, with the coactivators CRTC1/TORC1, CRTC2/TORC2 and CRTC3/TORC3. When phosphorylated on Ser-119, binds CREBBP (By similarity). Interacts with CREBL2; regulates CREB1 phosphorylation, stability and transcriptional activity (By similarity). Interacts (phosphorylated form) with TOX3. Interacts with ARRB1. Binds to HIPK2. Interacts with SGK1. Interacts with TSSK4; this interaction facilitates phosphorylation on Ser-119 (PubMed:15964553). Forms a complex with KMT2A and CREBBP (By similarity) (PubMed:14506290, PubMed:14536081, PubMed:15454081, PubMed:15733869, PubMed:15964553, PubMed:16325578, PubMed:16908542, PubMed:20573984, PubMed:21172805, PubMed:23651431). Interacts with TOX4; CREB1 is required for full induction of TOX4-dependent activity and the interaction is increased by cAMP and inhibited by insulin (By similarity). Interacts with LYL1 in a complex consisting of LYL1, CREB1 and EP300 (PubMed:18160048)"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with hepatitis B virus/HBV protein X"},{"topic":"Subunit","text":"(Microbial infection) Interacts with HTLV-1 protein Tax"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"P16220-1","name":"2","synonyms":["CREB-A"],"notes":[],"length":341,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000432329.6","ENST00000915136.1","ENST00000961891.1"],"refseq":["NM_001371426.1","NM_001445698.1","NM_001445699.1","NM_134442.5"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001358355.1","NP_001432627.1","NP_001432628.1","NP_604391.1"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,86],[101,87,241]],"edits":[{"start":86,"end":86,"original":"V","replacement":"VQSSCKDLKRLFSGT","added":15}],"missing":0,"replaced":0,"novel":14,"foldedAbsent":0,"foldedM